            {
              "id": "177472a6-daf4-414e-9c91-d6fc66a4a263",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Game Cultures: Computer Games As New Media</strong></em> was written by Jon Dovey, published by Open University Press, May 1, 2006."
            },
            {
              "id": "ba3a4803-8bd1-45e0-b420-829955393952",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "f6f99e54-fcbe-46cf-98ba-cdb2bef8a020",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>The authors provide an analysis of computer games as the most popular contemporary form of new media production and consumption, and examine their impact on established frameworks and concepts within cultural and media studies.</em>"
            },
